{"id":"n001904bb07","headline":"Budget 2026: Centre to develop rare earth corridors to reduce China dependence","summary":"The Centre will develop rare earth corridors to reduce China dependence, building on a scheme approved last year to promote sintered rare earth permanent magnet manufacturing with an outlay of Rs 7,280 crore.","why":"Rare earth magnets are critical inputs for electric vehicles, wind turbines and electronics, and China dominates their supply chain, so diversification efforts affect global industrial supply.","category":"commodities","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.614,"lon":77.209,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/technology/budget-2026-centre-to-develop-rare-earth-corridors-to-reduce-china-dependence/articleshow/127840081.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/technology/budget-2026-centre-to-develop-rare-earth-corridors-to-reduce-china-dependence/articleshow/127840081.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-02-01T11:12:08Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T20:10:53Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"0eed24e3a60f13ea","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T20:10:53Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-02-01T11:12:08Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-02-01T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/mining-truck-2164146.jpg","alt":"mining truck (illustration)","credit":"stafichukanatoly","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/dumper-giant-size-car